030aca783:r4:c77aa7243964de78","span_id":"es15"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_4abb718dd9c030aca783:revision:4","quote":"主要终点：第16周达到HiSCR75（化脓性汗腺炎临床应答，炎性结节与脓肿总数较基线减少≥75%且无脓肿、无瘘管增加）的受试者比例；评价时间点为第16周（30mg/15mg剂量层与安慰剂比较）","quote_sha256":"33c3dcd5db5b55b29608627218568d501df78b60ccbae7d18377e824e4e5e837","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_4abb718dd9c030aca783:r4:c77aa7243964de78","span_id":"es16"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_4abb718dd9c030aca783:revision:4","quote":"次要疗效终点：第16周疼痛NRS较基线变化、HiSCR50/90比例、脓肿与炎性结节计数变化、皮肤病学生活质量指数（DLQI）较基线变化、达到HiSCR75的应答维持时间","quote_sha256":"b2341aad8a576269a526673892fd890b3e2277eb75d56c85a83ab174ca7ad345","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_4abb718dd9c030aca783:r4:c77aa7243964de78","span_id":"es17"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_4abb718dd9c030aca783:revision:4","quote":"主要安全性终点：治疗期严重不良事件（SAE）与导致研究药物停药的不良事件发生率（至第52周）","quote_sha256":"8364d4d4db2de6696a71b20d4ae3a15cca1d6bd757cc25ea07aedd66ee6762c8","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_4abb718dd9c030aca783:r4:c77aa7243964de78","span_id":"es18"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_4abb718dd9c030aca783:revision:4","quote":"次要安全性终点：TEAE发生率与严重程度、AESI发生率（感染、肝酶升高、血脂异常、中性粒细胞减少）、生命体征与实验室检查较基线变化","quote_sha256":"269e72524de4a504c8ed8147936dc00d2f437d222594de99adac0322257c1c72","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_4abb718dd9c030aca783:r4:c77aa7243964de78","span_id":"es19"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_4abb718dd9c030aca783:revision:4","quote":"特别关注的不良事件：感染（机会性感染、结核再激活）、肝功能异常（ALT/AST>3×ULN伴胆红素升高）、血脂异常（LDL-C显著升高）、中性粒细胞减少（ANC<1.0×10⁹/L）、恶性肿瘤与严重心血管事件","quote_sha256":"8eca61e77db1d2cbbb1c73d203998c11fe06408c5d1fb4984c62fe3c2194b2fa","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_4abb718dd9c030aca783:r4:c77aa7243964de78","span_id":"es20"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_4abb718dd9c030aca783:revision:4","quote":"访视策略：筛选（V1，第−4至−1周）；基线（V2，第0周，随机给药）；剂量探索期每2周随访（第2/4/6/8/10/12周）；PoC期每4周随访（第16/20/24/28/32/36/40/44/48周）；第52周终访（HiSCR评估、病灶计数、DLQI）；第56周安全性随访（AE、实验室、生命体征）","quote_sha256":"0dff7b5c0839064d75565835a9bac8fd6c8f066028fb7c4404517a1fb3ba652d","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_4abb718dd9c030aca783:r4:c77aa7243964de78","span_id":"es21"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_4abb718dd9c030aca783:revision:4","quote":"估计目标策略：主要估计目标为治疗策略估计（treatment policy）：所有随机化受试者按原随机分组分析，不论依从性；主要终点变量为第16周HiSCR75二分类结局；对过早停药或接受禁用治疗者第16周视为无应答（非应答填补）；敏感性分析采用符合方案集估计","quote_sha256":"e253e1e055b41f562fe1f374bd0df043d0128ad03723f4a77fb95a857065f390","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_4abb718dd9c030aca783:r4:c77aa7243964de78","span_id":"es22"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_4abb718dd9c030aca783:revision:4","quote":"样本量策略：基于安慰剂组HiSCR75约20%、30mg组预期45%的第16周应答差（Δ=25%），α=0.05（双单侧0.025）、把握度90%，每组约45例，四组共约180例（考虑15%脱落放大至每组52例、共208例）","quote_sha256":"9d93fa0e08021fbd464c19be41550f14c4aaa0e9c1a1572c422eebab33904fc8","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_4abb718dd9c030aca783:r4:c77aa7243964de78","span_id":"es23"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_4abb718dd9c030aca783:revision:4","quote":"主要分析采用CMH检验（按Hurley分期与基线疼痛NRS分层校正）比较各剂量组与安慰剂第16周HiSCR75比例，报告率差及95%CI；关键次要终点按固定序列（fixed-sequence）层级控制整体I类错误；敏感性分析（PP集、替代填补）与亚组分析支持性呈现；安全性分析采用安全性分析集描述性汇总","quote_sha256":"3fa257cc430abd425161831f6d6e39dcab118c049e08b3815e5f2bffdeb68da3","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_4abb718dd9c030aca783:r4:c77aa7243964de78","span_id":"es24"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_4abb718dd9c030aca783:revision:4","quote":"自适应设计是否计划：否","quote_sha256":"c71bda4d6101542f8a3c2bb0087631982c72176be9ca9a2526dc2c08ed0ee52a","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_4abb718dd9c030aca783:r4:c77aa7243964de78","span_id":"es25"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_4abb718dd9c030aca783:revision:4","quote":"样本量再估计是否计划：否","quote_sha256":"913a62236e4f43